      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "零.应用减法可以解决数量变化的各种问题."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题1.白天气温变化了$-12^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$.傍晚气温为$-8^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$.早",
        "晨的气温是多少度？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "设早晨的气温为$x$.根据题意$x+(-12)=-8$.按减法",
        "的意义$x=-8-(-12)=-8+12=4$.早晨的气温是$4^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题2.早晨的气温是$5^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$，傍晚的气温是$-2^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$.白天",
        "气温变化多少度？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "设气温变化$x^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$.于是有$5+x=-2$.即：$x=-2-5$，",
        "$x=-7$.气温变化了$-7^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题3.求端点为$A(-5),B(9)$的线段的长."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "线段$AB$的长表示，若使点$A$移到点$B$，点$A$要向右移多",
        "远，也就是说$-5$加上几才能得9.所以，如果用$x$表示线段",
        "$AB$的长，则有：$-5+x=9$.解方程得：$x=9-(-5)$，$x=14$.",
        "即线段$AB$的长等于14."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一般地说，**求线段的长，必须从它右端点的坐标减去它左**",
        "**端点的坐标.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "390",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "昨天，温度计指示的温度是$x^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$，今天气温降低了$12^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$.",
        "当$x=25,16,12,10,6,0$时，今天的气温是多少度？用加",
        "法和减法两种方法解这个问题."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "391",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "设：",
        "1) $a=18,b=16$；　　2) $a=-2.3,b=-0.5$；",
        "3) $a=44,b=-7$；　　4) $a=-4.8,b=3.9$.",
        "检验等式$a-(-b)=a+b$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "392",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
